\cf2 \cb5 QTCinderella started with games, added cooking and baking, and increasingly made organizing social events part of her identity. Her streams can involve preparing food, talking with chat, entertaining friends, and planning ambitious productions.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 She founded The Streamer Awards, creating a major event that connects multiple creators and their fan communities. \cf0 \cb1 \
