\f1\b0\fs24 \cf6 \cb5 \strokec6 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f5 Travel, cultural curiosity, and everyday adventure\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs28 \cf2 \cb5 \strokec2 Jinnytty built her career around travel and real-world exploration, connecting with English-speaking and Asian audiences. Her 2023 Waddlethon involved walking approximately 1,076 kilometers around Taiwan while livestreaming. \cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

