\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b \cf2 \cb5 What made it work:
\f0\b0  A trip supplies its own narrative: destinations, discoveries, logistical problems, unexpected encounters, exhaustion, and progress. Jinnytty's interactions with the surroundings\'97and with the people she meets\'97are central to the experience.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb5 Her streams demonstrate something especially valuable: the camera can substitute for the viewer being somewhere else. Viewers become virtual travel companions.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b \cf2 \cb5 Transferable lesson:
\f0\b0  You don't necessarily need extraordinary places. A local neighborhood, farmers market, workshop, or unfamiliar business can be interesting if the host notices things, explains them, asks questions, and allows curiosity to guide the experience.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
