\f3\b \cf2 \cb5 Transferable lesson:
\f0\b0  Local culture and human encounters can be more compelling than expensive sets. However, large public streams require safety planning, cooperation with local people, reliable mobile production, and responsible treatment of bystanders.\cf0 \cb1 \
