\f3\b \cf2 \cb5 What made it work:
\f0\b0  A combination of awkward humor, willingness to try bizarre ideas, and an audience that can immediately understand the premise of each stream.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb5 One of her advantages is that even a short clip can explain the joke: a viewer sees someone doing something outrageous and wants to know what happens next.\cf0 \cb1 \
