\cf2 \cb5 Big Clive built an audience around electronics exploration, teardowns, circuit explanations, and technical curiosity.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 His Patreon includes relaxed, patron-only livestreams alongside early access to technical videos. He describes that membership community as a way to maintain a more independent connection with viewers. \cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

