\fs16 \cf6 \cb7 \strokec6 Patreon
\f0\fs28 \cf0 \cb1 \strokec2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb5 This represents a very different style from spectacular Twitch productions.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 The attraction is the creator's curiosity, experience, dry humor, and willingness to examine things that most people would never think to investigate.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 A viewer might stay because of an unusual circuit, the unexpected construction of a cheap consumer gadget, or simply the pleasure of listening to someone knowledgeable exploring it.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b \cf2 \cb5 What made it work:
\f0\b0  Consistency of subject and personality, specialist knowledge, distinctive explanations, and a niche with genuine enthusiasm.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb5 The workbench also creates a natural membership proposition: some viewers want more time in the workshop with the creator, not necessarily more polished content.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf2 \cb5 <$Scr_H::3>
\f8\b\fs40 Case study: Adrian Black \'97 the detective-story repair format\cf0 \cb1 \
