\cf2 \cb5 Adrian's Digital Basement centers on diagnosing, restoring, and exploring vintage computers and electronics.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 His work includes long-form repairs, follow-up experiments, viewer-submitted equipment, behind-the-scenes updates, and occasional supporter livestreams. His website also links to Patreon, merchandise, and viewer donations. \cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f6\fs24 \cf0 {\*\shppict{\pict {\*\nisusfilename favicons}\picw32\pich32\picwgoal640\pichgoal640\jpegblip }}\
