\fs16 \cf6 \cb7 \strokec6 Adrian's Digital Basement\cf8 \cb1 \strokec8 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf8 \cb7 +1\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb5 This format is compelling because many repairs resemble detective stories.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 There's an unknown problem. The expert develops a theory. Tests reveal new information. Sometimes the repair succeeds; sometimes another mystery appears.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 There is no need to manufacture drama. The diagnostic process naturally produces it.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b \cf2 \cb5 The transferable idea:
\f0\b0  Present work as a sequence of questions and discoveries rather than as a continuous demonstration of technique.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb5 The audience can follow the reasoning even when it doesn't understand every technical detail.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

