\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \cb5 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f0\fs28 The8BitDrummer's show is built around playing drums to music, with viewer suggestions and a lighthearted community atmosphere.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 He has streamed regularly, using a recognizable schedule, audience song suggestions, community rules, and interactive alerts. His YouTube presence surpassed one million followers by 2025. \cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

