\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb5 The activity is impressive, but his cheerful reactions and interactions also give people a reason to return.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b \cf2 \cb5 Why it works:
\f0\b0  A constant supply of new musical challenges combined with an immediately recognizable host experience.\cf0 \cb1 \

\f3\b \cf2 \cb5 The lesson:
\f0\b0  Being good at something is a strong foundation. Making viewers feel welcome while you do it can be even more important for retaining them.\cf0 \cb1 \
