\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \cb5 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f0\fs28 James Scholz became known for long study-with-me broadcasts, often featuring 12-hour study sessions, quiet routines, and Pomodoro-style time management.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 His June 2021 12-hour study-with-me broadcast had accumulated more than 1.3 million views, according to its YouTube listing. In his own account, he explained how his daily studying had grown into a community of people working alongside him. \cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

