\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb5 This is fascinating because it reverses several assumptions about streaming.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 The creator doesn't need to be talking constantly. He doesn't need surprising guests or wild challenges. The audience receives something closer to companionship and accountability.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 YouTube itself has identified the study-with-me format as a way that ordinary solitary tasks become communal experiences. \cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

