\cf2 \cb5 At smaller sizes, remembering regular viewers, maintaining conversation, and building recurring traditions can be a real advantage.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 At larger sizes, moderation, channel culture, shared references, and established formats become more important.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

