\f1\fs24 \cf2 \cb5 <$Scr_H::2>
\f4\b\fs48 The larger conclusion\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \cb5 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f0\fs28 There are at least three substantially different types of successful personality streamer.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 The 
\f3\b entertainer
\f0\b0  makes being with them the primary attraction. Kai Cenat, ExtraEmily, and Ludwig illustrate different versions of this.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 The 
\f3\b interpreter
\f0\b0  makes the world more understandable or entertaining through their commentary. Hasan, Asmongold, and Emily D. Baker illustrate that approach.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 The 
\f3\b practitioner
\f0\b0  gives viewers access to a real skill, endeavor, workshop, or ongoing project. Pirate Software, Big Clive, Adrian Black, and Maya Higa are useful examples.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 For the particular combination of Just Chatting, lifestyle, IRL, workbench, and reactions, I find the practitioner-personality hybrid especially interesting. It doesn't require perpetual spectacle, and it can create a richer relationship between authentic work, curiosity, conversation, and community.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 The idea I would emphasize most is this:\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b \cf2 \cb5 Successful livestreamers don't always need fascinating lives. They need to make the experience of spending time in their world fascinating.
\f0\b0 \cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb5 And sometimes a small workshop with one personable, curious, knowledgeable person is a much better foundation for that than a million-dollar production.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \cb10 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb5 I'd be interested in one distinction about your goal: 
\f3\b are you researching the phenomenon of successful livestreamers, or are you considering developing a livestream production yourself?
\f0\b0  That would determine whether the most useful next level is a deeper historical study of unusual success stories, or a practical breakdown of production techniques, audience development, and business models specifically for workbench/IRL/personality programming.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\qc\partightenfactor0

