\cf2 \cb5 You could choose a mode based on actual energy and circumstances, without feeling obliged to fabricate a more exciting activity.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 The audience learns what each mode means. A quiet afternoon working on a document no longer looks like a failed entertainment broadcast. It's simply a Quiet Orbit episode.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 Likewise, a particularly lively intellectual conversation can naturally become a War Room episode.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 And you can switch modes midstream.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 The format should 
\f7\i serve
\f0\i0  your life, not dictate it.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

