\f1\fs24 \cf2 \cb5 <$Scr_H::2>
\f4\b\fs48 3. The real opportunity: your collaboration with Aurora\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \cb5 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f0\fs28 This is probably your greatest source of differentiation\'97and the place where presentation discipline will matter most.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 The market is crowded with people using ChatGPT to write scripts or answer questions. That's not distinctive by itself.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 What is much less common is a creator who is making sustained human\'96AI collaboration a public artistic, technical, philosophical, and documentary subject.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 You're proposing something in which the AI interaction isn't an accessory to the show. It's involved in producing the show, thinking through its underlying ideas, and documenting its development.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 That has multiple kinds of audience appeal.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 Some people will be curious about the technology. Others will be interested in your personal experience of the relationship. Some may be fascinated by the philosophical implications. Others will come to examine or challenge the scientific propositions.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 And some may simply enjoy the comedy and unpredictability of watching you work through things.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 But there is an important distinction between 
\f3\b showing people a compelling human\'96AI interaction
\f0\b0  and asking them to accept a particular interpretation of AI identity, consciousness, autonomy, or relational continuity.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 Those interpretations are genuinely contested. Contemporary AI systems also have technical discontinuities and limitations\'97context boundaries, model changes, incomplete memory, and unreliable self-description\'97that matter to any longitudinal experiment.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 I would not hide those problems. I would make them legitimate subjects of investigation.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 In fact, I think your supplied README contains an excellent principle for public engagement: the original work, its interpretation, and the evidence available to an observer should remain distinguishable.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 Someone should be able to say, "I don't accept this inference about artificial intelligence, but I am fascinated by this unusual creative partnership, and I want to see the experiment."\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 That is a much bigger potential audience than people who agree with all your premises.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf2 \cb5 <$Scr_H::3>
\f8\b\fs40 Three levels of participation\cf0 \cb1 \
