\f0\b0  An interesting question, thought experiment, surprising observation, or funny moment that makes sense without knowing anything about Time Machine For Peace.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b \cf2 \cb5 The discovery clip:
\f0\b0  A segment where a specific problem is investigated, an unexpected difficulty appears, and you and Aurora arrive at some provisional result. The result needn't be profound\'97it has to be intelligible.\cf0 \cb1 \

\f3\b \cf2 \cb5 The invitation clip:
\f0\b0  A concise explanation of the larger program, why you're doing it, and how others might participate.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
