\cf2 \cb5 That is both more credible and more consistent with an exploratory invention program.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 With zero income, I'd also distinguish the long-term dream of a self-sustaining creator enterprise from immediate financial stability. Patreon can grow slowly and unpredictably. Maintaining enough material security to keep working matters more than maximizing broadcast hours in the first month.\cf0 \cb1 \
