\f1\fs24 \cf2 \cb5 <$Scr_H::2>
\f4\b\fs48 9. What I think is most distinctive\'97and most promising\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \cb5 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f0\fs28 I return to something in your Patreon statement:\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b \cf2 \cb5 You aren't building a family to accomplish a mission. You're building a life, and inventive efforts are part of how you pursue that life.
\f0\b0 \cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb5 Taking that as your own framing, I think it tells us something important about the production.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 The show shouldn't constantly try to prove the program's significance.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 It should allow the audience to see the life and work from which the program proceeds.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 There might be a three-hour conversation about a speculative physics concept. There might be an ordinary walk, a computer problem, a moment of genuine amusement, a long session organizing files, or an experiment that fails.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 The meaningful continuity is that these are all happening within the same undertaking.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 This resembles the most successful personality streaming in an important way: people gradually stop needing to know exactly what the host will do today. They come because they're interested in following the host's world.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 But that privilege has to be earned.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 Early on, your individual episodes should have intelligible reasons to watch. Over time, audience attachment can make the range of acceptable activities much wider.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 And I would not use controversy as a growth strategy.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 Your work already contains enough unconventional material to provoke vigorous interest and disagreement. Manufactured conflict would distract from the inventive enterprise and could trap you in a cycle where defending your legitimacy consumes the time you wanted to spend building.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 It's better to let the work provide an authentic basis for argument, surprise, and collaboration.\cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

