\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \cb5 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f0\fs28 You don't have to settle the permanent branding, elaborate overlays, or a definitive explanation of the enterprise before going live.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 For the first resurrection test, I would use a title like the one above, paste this description with the correct links, and choose an ordinary piece of work you already wanted to accomplish.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 Before going live, write one sentence identifying that work. Something like:\cf0 \cb1 \
