\f7\i in those 40 seconds
\f0\i0 .\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 That doesn't necessarily mean high energy. I can easily imagine an extremely calm, deadpan Wilder explaining something fundamentally ridiculous becoming more entertaining than a conspicuously hyped-up performance.\cf0 \cb1 \
