\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \cb5 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f0\fs28 Not inherently.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 In fact, YouTube's current monetization policies explicitly favor original, authentic material and caution against repetitive or emotionally manipulative content made primarily to attract views. Commentary, creative narration, and substantial original reactions are recognized as potentially monetizable forms. \cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

