\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \cb5 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f0\fs28 YouTube's live copyright system scans broadcasts for third-party content. If a match is identified, YouTube may warn you, interrupt the stream, replace the video with a placeholder, or terminate the broadcast if the identified material continues. Archived streams may subsequently receive Content ID claims. \cf0 \cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

