\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \cb5 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f0\fs28 This is considerably simpler.\cf0 \cb1 \
\cf2 \cb5 The US Copyright Office explains that copyright owners generally control public performance and display of their protected literary works. If you genuinely own those rights, you ordinarily do not need to rely on fair use to read or display the work yourself. \cf0 \cb1 \
